i-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-9ebd056e920b5b47END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-5fdacc5b1e11973eEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_UNI_WYR_Schematics</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_WYR_Schematics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_WYR_Schematics\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">4e70d122-a9ea-4734-87a2-44feb778bc20</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:4e70d122-a9ea-4734-87a2-44feb778bc20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:4e70d122-a9ea-4734-87a2-44feb778bc20\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/25px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/38px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/50px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Enver Gortash's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/25px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">Enver Gortash's</a> Office on the top floor of <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Rock_Fortress\" title=\"Wyrm's Rock Fortress\">Wyrm's Rock Fortress</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[This portfolio notebook is stuffed with page after page of diagrams and schematics, recognisable as <a href=\"/wiki/Gondians\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gondians\">Gondian</a> designs for magically enhanced mechanisms, but amended and expanded by notes in Gortash's precise handwriting, with emendations such as infernal 'hellfire' power sources, illithid synapse-cable wiring, and even <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki\" title=\"Githyanki\">githyanki</a> image projection hexnology. Particularly striking is a diagram of a giant <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher\" title=\"Steel Watcher\">Steel Watcher</a> variant, with a note in Gortash's hand reading, 'Weight insupportable? Cut the mass'.]\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714234317\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.057 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1848/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32196/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8604/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936233/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   47.988      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   47.988      1 -total\n 59.11%   28.367      8 Template:Icon_text\n 53.28%   25.567     19 Template:Trim\n 25.93%   12.445      2 Template:Uid\n 14.16%    6.793      3 Template:Icon_link\n 13.30%    6.381      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.94%    6.209      2 Template:Template_style\n  9.44%    4.532      8 Template:Ifempty\n  9.31%    4.467      2 Template:CharLink\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12453-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714234317 and revision id 364870. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}